From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 04:07:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 4655 rebuilt: each person's message carries only their own
 part (OFF)

0226 split "ask Gela ..., and ask Levan to introduce me to Nino" into two
parts, so the question to Gela went out, but the model wrote Levan's
introduction into Gela's one message (tester 56014) and 0226 was
reverted. The split now comes only together with an own-part check: a
question that names the go-between or the target of another part's
introduction is refused, and the model sends each part to its own person.

Both sit behind OWN_PART_ONLY_ON, false until Misho says yes to the
refusal sentence (OTHER_PART_REFUSAL); off, the guard is exactly main's.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
